  <h2>Documentation contract</h2>
  <p>Every browser-facing operation needs a Utoipa path so it appears in <code>/openapi.json</code> and Scalar at <code>/docs</code>. Every module also needs at least one enforced public-boundary scenario under <code>features/suites</code>. Native-only operations remain represented in the Protobuf capability manifest.</p>
